<svg class="flame-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800.0 262.0" role="img" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><title>Portfolio commit activity</title><text x="16" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#222">portfolio activity</text><text x="16" y="40" class="muted">one card per repo · heat bands · cycling</text><style>
            .bar {
                stroke: #fff;
                stroke-width: 2;
                rx: 4;
            }
            .lbl {
                fill: #fff;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            .sub {
                fill: #fff;
                font-size: 11px;
                opacity: .92;
            }
            .dim {
                fill: #333;
                font-size: 12px;
            }
            .wht {
                fill: #fff;
                font-size: 10px;
                paint-order: stroke;
                stroke: rgba(0, 0, 0, .45);
                stroke-width: 3px;
                stroke-linejoin: round;
            }
            .muted {
                fill: #666;
                font-size: 11px;
            }
            .pulse {
                animation: breathe 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
            }
            .slow {
                animation-duration: 3.4s;
            }
            @keyframes breathe {
                0%, 100% { opacity: .95; }
                50% { opacity: .62; }
            }
            .halo {
                transform-box: fill-box;
                transform-origin: center;
                animation: halo 2.2s ease-out infinite;
            }
            @keyframes halo {
                0% { opacity: .75; transform: scale(1); }
                100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(2.4); }
            }
            .card {
                opacity: 0;
                animation: whisk ease-in-out infinite;
                animation-iteration-count: infinite;
            }
            .deck .card#r0 {
                opacity: 1;
            }
            @keyframes whisk {
                0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(60px); }
                3% { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
                10% { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
                13% { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-60px); }
                100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-60px); }
            }
            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
                .pulse, .halo, .card { animation: none; }
            }
        </style><rect x="16.0" y="52.0" width="768.0" height="34.0" rx="4" fill="#222"/><text x="28.0" y="74.0" class="lbl">portfolio · 84 commits / 30d · heat 2.5 heating</text><svg x="742.0" y="61" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#D55E00" class="pulse"><path d="M8 0 C10 3 13 6 13 10 A5 5 0 0 1 3 10 C3 8 4 6.5 5 5.5 C5.5 7 6.5 7.5 6.5 7.5 C6 5 7 2.5 8 0 Z"/></svg><svg x="749.0" y="60" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#D55E00" class="pulse" style="animation-delay:-0.73s"><path d="M8 0 C10 3 13 6 13 10 A5 5 0 0 1 3 10 C3 8 4 6.5 5 5.5 C5.5 7 6.5 7.5 6.5 7.5 C6 5 7 2.5 8 0 Z"/></svg><svg x="756.0" y="59" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="#D55E00" class="pulse" style="animation-delay:-1.47s"><path d="M8 0 C10 3 13 6 13 10 A5 5 0 0 1 3 10 C3 8 4 6.5 5 5.5 C5.5 7 6.5 7.5 6.5 7.5 C6 5 7 2.5 8 0 Z"/></svg><text x="16.0" y="96.0" font-size="10" fill="#9198a1">30d ago</text><text x="784.0" y="96.0" font-size="10" text-anchor="end" fill="#9198a1">today</text><linearGradient id="grad-r0" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0.000" stop-color="#BBBBBB" stop-opacity="0.55"/><stop offset="0.210" stop-color="#BBBBBB" stop-opacity="0.55"/><stop offset="0.321" stop-color="#56B4E9" stop-opacity="0.55"/><stop offset="0.926" stop-color="#E69F00" stop-opacity="0.55"/><stop offset="1.000" stop-color="#D55E00" stop-opacity="0.55"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="grad-r1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0.000" stop-color="#BBBBBB" stop-opacity="0.55"/><stop offset="1.000" stop-color="#BBBBBB" stop-opacity="0.55"/></linearGradient><g id="r0" class="card pulse" style="animation-duration:8.0s;animation-delay:0s"><rect x="16.0" y="100.0" width="768.0" height="104.0" rx="4" fill="url(#grad-r0)"><title>big · 81 commits/30d · heat 2.63 heating · top: main (27)</title></rect><line x1="177.2" y1="100.0" x2="177.2" y2="110.0" stroke="#9198a1" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"/><text x="177.2" y="96.0" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9198a1">15d</text><line x1="262.5" y1="100.0" x2="262.5" y2="110.0" stroke="#9198a1" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"/><text x="262.5" y="96.0" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9198a1">5d</text><line x1="727.1" y1="100.0" x2="727.1" y2="110.0" stroke="#9198a1" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"/><text x="727.1" y="96.0" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" fill="#9198a1">1d</text><text x="32.0" y="130.0" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#222">big</text><text x="32.0" y="152.0" class="dim" font-weight="bold">Heat sketch for the portfolio map</text><text x="32.0" y="168.0" class="sub">81 commits · 96.4% of portfolio · heat 2.6 heating · Rust</text><text x="32.0" y="182.0" class="wht">#viz #svg</text></g><g id="r1" class="card " style="animation-duration:8.0s;animation-delay:-4.0s"><rect x="16.0" y="100.0" width="768.0" height="104.0" rx="4" fill="url(#grad-r1)"><title>small · 3 commits/30d · heat 0.00 dormant · top: main (3)</title></rect><text x="32.0" y="130.0" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#222">small</text><text x="32.0" y="152.0" class="dim" font-weight="bold"></text><text x="32.0" y="168.0" class="sub">3 commits · 3.6% of portfolio · heat 0.0 dormant · Rust</text><text x="32.0" y="182.0" class="wht"></text></g><g font-size="12" fill="#9198a1"><circle cx="24" cy="220" r="6" fill="#D55E00"/><text x="36" y="224">heating &gt;1.5</text><circle cx="150" cy="220" r="6" fill="#E69F00"/><text x="162" y="224">steady ~1.0</text><circle cx="268" cy="220" r="6" fill="#56B4E9"/><text x="280" y="224">cooling &lt;0.5</text><circle cx="392" cy="220" r="6" fill="#BBBBBB"/><text x="404" y="224">dormant</text><text x="16" y="250" font-size="11" fill="#9198a1">color = pace vs own usual (1.0 = usual); bands run oldest → newest, lines mark the 1d / 5d / 15d window edges</text></g></svg>
